{"name":"Dekatreis","img":"modules/dekatreis/assets/images/Banner.jpg","caption":"A setting for the Pathfinder 2 system, created by <a href=\"https://twitter.com/VeilzaKinsemi\">Veilza Kinsemi</a>.","sort":-1,"description":"<h3>Dekatreis</h3><p>Once a planet of nothing but water and sparse land, the planet of Dekatreis grew to become a multi-landmass world after being founded and moulded into shape by adventurers who gained god-like powers through artefacts, many of which have been hidden away. After the era known as the Departure of the Demigods, foreseeing chaos to fall over the world without a coherent leader, a child of one of the Demigods rose to power and took control, calling herself “The Queen.” Creating 5 distinct kingdoms–Azor, Akiira, Totara, Sarille, and Dekatreis–The Queen placed princes and princesses in charge to rule autonomously while stepping into the shadows, relying on those who she chose to act.</p><h3>The Current Time</h3><p>Through the years of the Queen’s rule, there have been many conflicts. The kingdoms of Sarille, Dekatreis, and Akiira went to war–ending with the utter destruction of the kingdom of Akiira through magical corruption, enabling a new kingdom, Arcadia, to grow from parts of the ruins. The kingdom of Azor split into two, causing the Southern continent to become Azoranthium. The Queen’s necessity to step in to resolve the conflicts yet always too late has lead many to question her authority, but always in whispered breaths.</p><p>All the while, sinister forces attempt to dig their nails into an unstable world, often leaving the citizens of each kingdom to take care of the messes themselves while the Princes and Princesses struggle to maintain power over in a world where their Queen has drifted into silence.</p>","actors":[],"combats":[],"items":[],"journal":[],"scenes":[{"_id":"LLsVkBuLj7mR9d4S","name":"Akiira, Kingdom","navigation":false,"navOrder":126368,"navName":"Akiira","thumb":"modules/dekatreis/assets/images/maps/thumbs/L